P:3D59:Palette:32 bytes -> PPU $3F00 at RESET
P:3D79:AttrRuns:attribute table runs (count, value), 0 ends; X=0 -> $23C8, X=$0F -> $2BC8
P:3D95:BlankRowPtr:-> BlankRow (26 x $10)
P:3D97:BlankRow:26 blank tiles ($10): PPU row source for ClearTextRow
