P:3F64:GameModeDispatch:frame handler: jump by gameMode ($FF)
P:3F6B:GameModeTable:by gameMode (see the MODE_* constants)
P:3F79:PlayModeIndex:= 3 (gameMode of the real game), compared with gameMode everywhere
P:3F7A:TitleModeIndex:= 1
P:3F7B:GameOverModeIndex:= 5, used when the demo ends
P:3F7C:UnusedGameMode6:sets gameMode = 0
P:3F81:GameOverFlyIn:mode 4: noise, the GAME OVER letters fly in while lives ($3C) counts down -> mode 5
P:3FA5:GameOverFlyIn_skip
P:3FA9:GameOverFlyIn_loop
P:3FC7:GameOverMode:mode 5: GAME OVER shown (lives counts up as a 256-frame timer), wipe, back to the title.
P:3FD4:ReturnToTitle:gameMode = title, sub mode 0
P:3FDF:GameOverWait:game over screen: the game keeps running; lives (0 after game over) counts 256 frames
P:3FEF:GameOverWait_rts
P:3FF0:UnusedPadding:free space before the vectors
P:3FFA:NmiVector
P:3FFC:ResetVector:JMP (ResetVector) restarts the game
P:3FFE:IrqVector
R:0:mpVramLo:music player: PPU address low byte of the next note
R:1:mpNote:music player: current note byte (lo nibble SQ1, hi nibble SQ2)
R:2:mpVramHi:music player: PPU address high byte of the song
R:3:mpStarted:music player: nonzero after the APU was initialised
R:4:mpTempoMask:music player: a note is read when (frameCounter & mask) == 0
R:23:micPrev:previous $4016 value (bit 2 = Famicom microphone)
R:24:micShoutCount:microphone toggles; 4 + resetCounter 10 -> music player
R:27:alienCount:aliens left in the formation (CountAliens, one column per frame)
R:28:alienCountTmp:CountAliens accumulator
R:29:playerSwitched:set by SwapPlayers; WipeIfPlayerSwitched wipes the screen once
R:2A:nmiBusy:set during NMI; an NMI that finds it set resets the game (watchdog)
R:2B:gameOverTimer:2P: $78 frames of "GAME OVER PLAYER n" before the other player continues
R:2C:deathDelay:DeathStep2: $3C frames after the "PLAYER n" text
R:2D:hudRedrawIndex:UpdateHudScores: next HUD tile pair to queue (0-$15)
R:2E:wipeRowSet:ScreenWipe: 0 = WipeRowsTitle (story), 1 = WipeRowsGame (InitNewGame)
R:2F:titleScrollTimer:title scroll-in: $EF frames
R:30:menuHoldTimer:title menu: Start/Select must be held 3 frames
R:31:menuSelect:title menu: bit 0 = 1P / 2P
R:32:unused32:only written (0) by TitleInit
R:33:wipeTimer:ScreenWipe column 31..1
R:34:sq1HiLast:last value written to SQ1_HI (rewrite only on change)
R:35:flagshipAttackTimer:set to $96 by FlagshipAttackTimer, counts down per frame; the attack starts at $4E
R:36:textVram:PrintText: PPU address of the text row
R:38:vramRowPtr:WriteVramRow: source of the 26 bytes
R:3A:rngSeed:incremented while waiting for vblank; added into randomTable every NMI
R:3B:rngSeed2:incremented when rngSeed wraps; never read
R:3C:twoPlayerGame:nonzero in a 2-player game until one player is out
R:3D:extraLifePending:nonzero until the 5000-point extra life is given (per player)
R:3E:otherExtraLifePending:same for the waiting player
R:3F:flagshipBonusTimer:$B4 after a flagship is shot; no enemy fire meanwhile
R:40:shotSound:player shot sound step (UpdateShotSound clears it after one step - TCRF bug)
R:41:explosionSound:player explosion: noise period 6..$0D, 0 = off
R:42:lives:GameHacking.org: lives
R:43:otherLives:lives of the player who is waiting (2P game)
R:44:autoFireTimer:GameHacking.org "auto-fire" 0044:01; CheckFireButton fires when it counts down to 0
R:4C:curJoy:buttons of the current player (synthesized by the demo AI in attract mode)
R:4E:pauseFlag:nonzero = game paused (Start)
R:4F:playerState:GameHacking.org "invincible": 004F:00; 0 = ship in play, 1-$21 explosion, $21 = waiting to spawn
R:50:explTileLo:UpdateBgTiles: player explosion tile address
R:51:explRow:UpdateBgTiles: player explosion row 3..0
R:53:curPlayer:bit 0 = which player is playing (2P game)
R:54:scoreAdd:digits to add (scoreAdd+3 = hundreds, +4 = tens), see AddScore
R:59:stage:GameHacking.org: stage modifier
R:5A:otherStage:stage of the player who is waiting (2P game)
R:5B:attackTimers:8 counters (every 4 frames), each wraps at AttackTimerPeriods,X; DifficultyAttackMask picks which launch
R:63:secondTimer:frames 0-59
R:64:difficultyTimer:seconds 0-19: difficulty + 1 every 20 seconds (max 7)
R:65:difficulty:min(stage, 7) at the start of a wave, then grows with time
R:66:attackSide:bit 0: LaunchFromLeft / LaunchFromRight
R:67:flagshipAttackCount:4-frame ticks up to FlagshipPeriod
R:68:diveSiren:$32 when a diver launches: siren while aliens dive
R:6B:songPtr:MusicChannelUpdate: song data pointer (songTable,X*2 - $0840)
R:6D:musRequest:per tune (0-3): start it; 0 extra life, 1 flagship hit, 2 alien hit, 3 game start.
R:71:musChannel:tune being updated (3..0)
R:72:musPos:per tune: position in the song
R:76:musTimer:per tune: note duration counter; musTimer+3 (start tune) != 0 blocks the hum and SpawnPlayer
R:7E:sndScratch:$7E-$8D cleared every frame by UpdateSound; $7E = 1 when a note starts
R:80:sq1PeriodLo:SQ1 period written by MusicChannelUpdate
R:81:sq1PeriodHi
R:8E:flagshipRespawn:nonzero: a lone flagship escaped, it comes back in column 4/5 next wave (current player)
R:90:otherFlagshipRespawn:same for the waiting player (swapped by SwapPlayers)
R:92:columnDivers:number of diving aliens per formation column (keeps the column for FormationBounce)
R:9C:modeTimer:general timer: title menu, story text, delay after a wave
R:9D:diverOam:current diver slot * 16 (OAM offset)
R:9E:diverSlot:current diver slot (0-7)
R:9F:waveCleared:set by CheckFormationEmpty when all 10 columns are empty
R:A0:eventQueue:ring buffer of formation columns to redraw
R:C0:eventHead:write index (QueueColumnRedraw)
R:C1:eventTail:read index (UpdateBgTiles)
R:C2:flapTimer:FormationFlapTimer: 9..0 = column to redraw, then down to -12
R:C3:formation:column bitmasks (column 0 = left): bits 0-2 blue rows, 3 purple, 4 red, 5 flagship
R:CD:formationOther:formation of the player who is waiting (2P game)
R:D7:redrawColumn:column being redrawn by UpdateBgTiles
R:D8:flapPhase:formation wing animation phase (+1 after each full redraw)
R:DA:tmp0:$DA-$E0: temporaries shared by many routines
R:DB:tmp1
R:DC:tmp2
R:DD:tmp3:also the direction quadrant of a diver
R:DE:tmp4:also Divide8 divisor, demo fire flag
R:DF:tmp5:also Divide8 dividend
R:E0:tmp6:also Divide8 result
R:E1:vramQueueCount:entries in the vramQueue* arrays (max 16), flushed in NMI
R:E2:srcPtr:PrintText: source of the text; RESET: destination of the CHR copies
R:E4:playerX:signed -$6A..+$6A, 0 = centre (ship X = playerX + $78); also the bottom scroll
R:E5:formationX:formation horizontal position (column X = col*16 + $30 + formationX)
R:E8:jumpTablePtr:JumpTableDispatch: return address of the JSR (= table - 1)
R:EA:jumpTarget:JumpTableDispatch: jump target
R:EC:motionTick:UpdateMotionSteps runs once per frameTick
R:ED:frameTick:incremented once per GameModeDispatch
R:EE:joy1Prev
R:EF:joy1:controller 1, bit 7 = A ... bit 0 = Right
R:F0:joy2Prev
R:F1:joy2:controller 2 (A+B = $C0 enables the music player)
R:F2:diverDirTmp:MoveDiver: direction index (diverDir / 4)
R:F6:scrollX
R:F7:scrollY
R:FA:ppuMaskShadow
R:FB:ppuCtrlShadow
R:FD:subStep:step inside a gameSubMode handler (death sequence, story text ...)
R:FE:gameSubMode:index for the per-mode jump tables
R:FF:gameMode:index into GameModeTable
R:100:stackPage:stack page base, STA stackPage,X
R:101:musicPlayerFlag:nonzero -> NMI runs MusicPlayer every frame. In REVA nothing sets it: ResetKeepSignature
R:102:frameCounter:24-bit, big-endian: $0102 high ... $0104 low
R:105:resetSignature:copy of "HARUHISA UDAGAWA" (TCRF)
R:115:resetCounter:TCRF: number of warm resets; $2D (45) / $0A (10) enable the music player
R:116:scoreArea:$0116-$012F, set to $10 (blank) at power-on; AddScore uses scoreArea,Y
R:117:scoreP1:BCD digits, tile $10 = blank
R:120:hiScore:5000 after power-on
R:129:scoreP2
R:14E:songTable:tune pointers as PPU addresses (RAM + SONG_PTR_BIAS); [0] set by InitMusicPtr
R:156:TuneGameStart:tune 3
R:1AB:TuneAlienHit:tune 2
R:1CD:TuneFlagshipHit:tune 1
R:200:oamBuffer:sprite page for OAM DMA ($4014 = $02)
R:300:chrData:RAM copy of PPU $1480-$17FF: text pointers and records (src/chr.asm)
R:301:textPtrs:PrintText: 2-byte pointers to the texts, as PPU addresses
R:380:TxtBorder:text record
R:396:TxtLogo0:text record
R:3AC:TxtLogo1:text record
R:3C2:TxtLogo2:text record
R:3D8:TxtLogo3:text record
R:3EE:TxtLogo4:text record
R:404:TxtLogo5:text record
R:410:TxtLogoNamcot:text record
R:41C:Txt1Up:text record
R:422:TxtHiscore:text record
R:42D:Txt2Up:text record
R:433:TxtMission:text record
R:44D:TxtWeAreTheGalaxians:text record
R:464:TxtScoreTable:text record
R:480:chrTiles:tiles $60-$6F (graphics) in the copied block
R:580:TxtConvoyCharger:text record
R:592:Txt1Player:text record
R:59D:Txt2Players:text record
R:5A9:TxtC19791984NamcoLtd:text record
R:5C1:TxtRights:text record
R:5D7:TxtPlayer1:text record
R:5E2:TxtPlayer2:text record
R:5ED:TxtGameOver:text record
R:5FA:TxtReady:text record
R:600:ramPage6:RESET clears $0600-$06FF (the text copy then overwrites $0600-$067F)
R:602:TxtPause:text record
R:60A:TxtBonus150:text record
R:610:TxtBonus200:text record
R:616:TxtBonus300:text record
R:61C:TxtBonus800:text record
R:622:TxtScoreRow0:text record
R:635:TxtScoreRow1:text record
R:648:TxtScoreRow2:text record
R:65B:TxtScoreRow3:text record
R:66E:Txt2UpLeft:text record
R:674:TxtBlankRow20:text record
R:677:TxtBlankRow18:text record
R:68F:demoTargetX:demo AI: X the ship walks to
R:690:hudBuffer:HUD tiles for PPU $2074-$209F (two rows): 22 pairs queued one per frame by UpdateHudScores
R:6A0:hudScore:score of the current player shown in the HUD (hudScore+9 = hiScore copy)
R:6B1:hudLives:ship icons, lower half (tile $6F; upper half $6E at hudBuffer+1)
R:6B5:hudFlags:stage flag icons (lower half; upper half at hudBuffer+5)
R:6B6:hudStageTens:stage number (stage >= 5) next to one flag; overlaps hudFlags+1
R:6B7:hudStageOnes
R:6BC:textBuf:one text row: PrintText fills it, WriteVramRow (NMI) copies it to textVram
R:6D6:textCharBias:subtracted from the characters by PrintText ($30 or 0)
R:6D7:textNtFlag:PrintText: nonzero = second nametable ($28xx); also a step counter of IntroTextSequence
R:6D8:randomTable:randomTable,X += rngSeed every NMI (X = frameTick & 15)
R:6E8:diverShots:bullets the diver may still fire (2, 3 from stage 1)
R:6F0:diverType:score index: formation row 0-5; escort 4; flagship 0 + 1 per escort launched or lost (bonus index)
R:6F8:diverEscort2:flagship: slot of the second escort
R:6FF:flagshipDir:-1 / +1: side of the flagship attack (= diverEscort2+7)
R:700:diverEscort1:flagship: slot of the first escort
R:707:flagshipColumn:column of the attacking flagship (= diverEscort1+7)
R:708:diverIsFlagship:$60 for a flagship (also its tile offset), else 0
R:710:diverDropY:state 4/9: frames left while dropping back into the formation
R:718:diverRow:formation row 0-5
R:720:diverColumn:formation column 0-9
R:728:diverTile:first tile of the 2x2 metasprite
R:730:diverDir:direction 0-$5F (diverDir / 4 indexes the Dir* tables); a frame counter in states 11-12
R:738:diverState:per diver slot: state for DiverStateDispatch
R:740:diverTargetX:X where the dive turns back toward the ship
R:748:vramQueueTile2:NMI queue: second tile
R:758:vramQueueTile1:NMI queue: first tile
R:768:vramQueueLo:NMI queue: PPU address low
R:778:vramQueueHi:NMI queue: PPU address high
R:788:motionDir:bit 7 = negative; GameHacking.org "enemy shooting affected" 078D:00 = motionDir+5
R:79F:formationDir:bit 7 = moving left (= motionDir+23), flipped by FormationBounce
R:7A0:motionDiv:divisor: speed = motionNum / motionDiv px per frame; 0 = object idle
R:7B8:motionNum:numerator, added to motionRem every frame
R:7D0:motionRem:remainder of the division (sub-pixel position)
R:7E8:motionStep:signed pixels per frame, computed by UpdateMotionSteps
R:7FF:formationDx:formation drift per frame (= motionStep+23)
